sequenceDiagram
    participant BE as Backend<br/>(FastAPI / asyncio)
    participant WS as WebSocket<br/>(/ws endpoint)
    participant App as App.tsx<br/>(React root)
    participant VL as VehicleLayer
    participant TLL as TrafficLightLayer
    participant HL as HeatmapLayer
    participant SB as Sidebar<br/>(Analytics · Charts · Congestion · Control)
    participant HDR as Header
    participant CAM as IntersectionCamera3D<br/>(Three.js)

    Note over BE: Simulation tick loop @ 50 Hz

    BE->>WS: broadcast SimulationState JSON @ 10 Hz

    WS-->>App: onmessage(event)
    App->>App: JSON.parse(event.data)
    App->>App: setSimState(parsed)

    Note over App: React schedules re-render

    par React reconciliation
        App->>VL: vehicles[] prop
        VL->>VL: diff markers by vehicle.id<br/>update lat/lng, bearing, color
    and
        App->>TLL: traffic_lights[] prop
        TLL->>TLL: diff markers by node_id<br/>update color dot (R/Y/G)
    and
        App->>HL: vehicles[] + heatmapOn prop
        HL->>HL: rebuild heatmap point array<br/>call heatLayer.setLatLngs()
    and
        App->>SB: kpi · scenario · edge_congestion<br/>green_wave · active_count
        SB->>SB: update StatCard values<br/>append Recharts data points<br/>re-draw congestion bars
    and
        App->>HDR: sim_clock · status · wsStatus<br/>active_count · totals
        HDR->>HDR: update clock display<br/>update status indicator
    end

    Note over App,CAM: Modal only active when selectedTL ≠ null

    opt 3D Modal open (selectedTL set)
        App->>CAM: vehicles · edgeStates · edgeBearings<br/>outgoingBearings · mode · phaseIndex · timeLeft
        CAM->>CAM: useEffect → update edgeStatesRef, modeRef<br/>(no Three.js rebuild)
        loop requestAnimationFrame @ ~60 fps
            CAM->>CAM: lerp vehicle positions → road geometry<br/>update signal bulb R/Y/G colors<br/>flash_yellow: Date.now() % 1000 < 500
        end
    end

    Note over WS,App: Connection lost → wsStatus = 'Əlaqə kəsilib'<br/>ws.onclose → attempt reconnect after 2 s

    WS-->>App: onclose / onerror
    App->>App: setWsStatus('Əlaqə kəsilib')
    App->>App: setTimeout(connect, 2000)
    App->>App: setWsStatus('Qoşulub') on reconnect
